flowchart LR
  intent[HOTL 0.2 intent graph\nversion + source hash] --> validate[static validator\ntypes • authority • bounds]
  validate --> plan[dry-run compiler plan]
  plan --> hermes[Hermes adapter\nKanban + Keel only]
  hermes --> events[append-only events\nnonces + provenance]
  events --> observed[observed O_t\nsnapshots / replay]
  observed --> projection[Starmap-style projection\nexplicit timeDomain + edge semantics]
  projection --> human[human gate\nsealed evidence + identity]
  human --> ledger[canonical Kanban / Keel\nno second scheduler]
  subgraph Runtime[External runtimes]
    adapter[OMP / Pi / other\ncapability-audited adapters]
  end
  plan -. unsupported => fail closed .-> adapter
